> EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT * FROM ga4_i8 i8 WHERE i8 = row(123,456)::ga4_i8
QUERY PLAN:text
Seq Scan on ga4_i8 i8
  Filter: (i8.* = '(123,456)'::ga4_i8)
